## What We Are Building

A comprehensive file translation system with quality evaluation and iterative improvement. This session focused on Phase 8: Multi-API Support, which adds DeepL and Google Translate translators alongside the existing OpenAI-compatible translator. The system includes a TranslatorSelector with priority-based selection and automatic fallback on failure.

Users can now configure multiple translation APIs with priorities, and the system will automatically select the best available translator and fall back to alternatives if the primary fails or is rate-limited.

