---

## What Did NOT Work (and why)

- **Circular import between __init__.py and selector.py** — failed because: selector.py imported from translators/__init__.py which imports selector.py
  - Fix: Used `TYPE_CHECKING` for type hints and lazy imports inside `_init_translators()` method
- **Variable shadowing in translate_batch** — failed because: Parameter named `requests` shadowed the `requests` module import
  - Fix: Renamed parameter to `translation_requests` in both DeepL and Google translators
- **gh pr review --approve** — failed because: Cannot approve your own pull request (GraphQL error)
  - Workaround: Used `--comment` instead to post the review

